- content_for :title, "Team Flow State ... OurGruuv"

%section.marketing-hero
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Flow State
    %h1.mb-3 Challenge. Clarity. Continuous Feedback.
    %p.lead.mb-4
      The research behind peak work ... and how OurGruuv helps People Teams put those conditions in place.

    %p.mb-0
      = link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark me-2"
      = link_to "See Solutions", solutions_path, class: "btn btn-dark"

%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Manifesto
    %h2.h3.mb-3 What we believe
    %p.lead
      Team flow isn’t a productivity hack. It’s what happens when expectations are clear, the work is challenging enough to matter, and feedback is continuous enough that nobody has to wait for review season to know where they stand.
    %p.text-muted.mb-0
      OurGruuv exists to help People Teams put those conditions in place ... shoulder to shoulder with employees and managers ... so fairness, growth, and talent density aren’t left to memory and vibes.

%section.marketing-section
  .container
    %h2.h3.mb-4 The three conditions
    .row.g-4
      .col-md-4
        %h3.h5 Challenge
        %p.text-muted.mb-0
          Not too easy, not crushing. The right stretch pulls people into deep engagement ... where growth and performance compound.
      .col-md-4
        %h3.h5 Clarity
        %p.text-muted.mb-0
          Clear goals, roles, and expectations. When everyone knows what good looks like, energy goes to the work ... not decoding the unspoken.
      .col-md-4
        %h3.h5 Continuous Feedback
        %p.text-muted.mb-0
          Real loops ... recognition, coaching, check-ins ... so teams stay aligned and can adjust without waiting for a calendar invite from HR.

%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %h2.h3.mb-3 The science (short version)
    %p.text-muted
      Flow state was described by psychologist Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi: optimal experience when challenge and skill meet, goals are clear, and feedback is immediate. At the team level, those same conditions create collective flow ... harmony, natural communication, and performance that exceeds the sum of individuals.
    %p.text-muted.mb-0
      OurGruuv doesn’t sell “flow” as a feature. We build the Path
      = succeed " ..." do
        = link_to "MAAP, check-ins, goals, and observations", solutions_path
      that make Challenge, Clarity, and Continuous Feedback real in everyday work.

    .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-4
      = link_to "Start Free", start_free_path, class: "btn btn-dark btn-lg px-4"
      = link_to "Home", root_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg"
